WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.760
I'm Meg Holloway with Common Tide.

2
00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:06.300
For sixty years, this marsh was cut off from the sea.

3
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:10.360
This year, the water came back, and so did the salmon.

4
00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.740
There's so much more coast waiting.

5
00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:16.320
This Giving Tuesday, help us bring back the next marsh.

6
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.900
Please give today.

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.920
Every donation counts.

8
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:20.760
Thank you.
